We need to map entities: namespace/Kind/name.

Identify entities involved: 
- otel-demo/PodChaos/otel-demo-product-catalog-network-delay-q5s8b (the chaos object) (contributing_factor true)
- otel-demo/Deployment/product-catalog-service (or maybe Service name "product-catalog-service") (contributing_factor true? Actually impacted by chaos, causing errors, so may be contributing_factor false as downstream effect? But root cause is chaos injection. However chaos modifies network delay of product-catalog, causing upstream service failures. So product-catalog is directly impacted, not root cause. So contributing_factor false.
- otel-demo/Service/frontend (alert)
- otel-demo/Service/frontend-proxy (alert)
- perhaps otel-demo/Deployment/frontend (maybe pods) but not needed.

